      `the provider respects the degree of rigour and the level of protection required to ensure the compliance of its high-risk AI systems with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 17(2) as enacted the provider has met paragraph 2` MEANS
        `the implementation of the aspects referred to in paragraph 1 is proportionate to the size of the provider's organisation`
    AND `the provider respects the degree of rigour and the level of protection required to ensure the compliance of its high-risk AI systems with this Regulation`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The implementation of the aspects referred to in paragraph 1 shall be proportionate to the size of the provider's organisation. Providers shall, in any event, respect the degree of rigour and the level of protection"

